      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Project Files**\n\nI'm currently focused on initiating the project files, with the critical first step being `fetch_api_key.py`. I plan to implement this using Microsoft/OpenAI. Subsequent \"scored\" files, according to the user, will integrate with one concrete external provider each. I am working on the first file and then will design files that meet the later steps of implementation.\n\n\n**Defining Project Components**\n\nI've moved on to defining the project components. I'm creating `security_models.py` and `security_client.py` to handle helper models and client utilities, including environment variable loading. For the initial file, `fetch_api_key.py`, I'll use Azure Key Vault, aligning with the Microsoft/OpenAI context. I'll design the subsequent files considering one external provider per \"scored\" file.\n\n\n**Outlining Project Files**\n\nI am now outlining the structure for the secret management project. I've broken the task into 10 Python files and decided on the external provider for each. First, I'm starting with `security_models.py` and `security_client.py`, which are local.  `fetch_api_key.py` will use Azure Key Vault, utilizing `DefaultAzureCredential` and `SecretClient`. My next step will be working on `security_models.py`.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
