      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing Key Vault Access**\n\nI'm now integrating Azure Key Vault for API key retrieval using `fetch_api_key.py`. This implementation leverages the functionalities defined in `security_client.py` and `security_models.py` to ensure secure key management within the application's workflow.\n\n\n",
